  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY EQUITY PROGRAMME (STEP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT AIMS AT PROVIDING EQUAL OPPORTUNITIES FOR STUDE_ NTS GRADUATING ISLAMIC SCHOOLS (PESANTREN) ENABLING THEM TO SUCCESSFULLY COMPETE FOR FELLOWSHIP IN HIGHER EDUCATION LEA_ DING TO CAREERS IN SCIENCE  TECHNOLOGY. THE PROJECT ENVISA_ GES THE CONSTRUCTION OF TWO MAGNET SCHOOLS PROVIDING IN_SER_ VICE TRAINING FOR TEACHERS FROM THE PESANTREN AND FOR PROVI_ DING FELLOWSHIPS FOR SELECTED MAGNET SCHOOL GRADUATES.</narrative>
  </description>
